      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Leaving a comment to remind anyone that's still interested. We could be saving seconds!!!\n\nBut srlsy, I've also had the idea to only enable saving with a config file/toggle deep in the settings. This way new players won't accidentally set weird settings and experienced players know what to do.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
